# Mechanic: K'rrik permits life payment for black mana in an accepted kicker cost.
# Forcing: Three Mountains cover generic mana but cannot pay either black symbol.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield leave no intervening decision.
# Failure modes: Missing final choices leave Duskwalker in hand. A retained optional choice changes a declined cast.
# Card roles: Duskwalker supplies base and kicker black symbols. K'rrik grants their life alternatives.
# Protocol path: Cast, optional-cost choice, complete mana choices, battlefield state.
